card "کلاس ۳", "har / jabtak — ginti, pehara, games. Loops dimagh ki gym hain."
card "کلاس ۴", "kaam() — apne functions. Phir website bhi Asaan Lang se."

unwan2 "Daakhla"
para "Umar 9 se 16 saal. Haftay mein 3 din, shaam 4 baje. Fees: mehnat, aur ek register."
para "Jagah: Kasur city. Ustani/ustad dono Roman-Urdu aur Urdu script padhate hain."

